## UtilityApi

### List languages
## List languages
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get language
## Get language
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

### Get API metadata
## Get API metadata
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/meta/
Accept: application/json
